{"metadata":{"name":"Sahih al Bukhari","section":{"29":{"eng-name":"Virtues of Madinah","ara-name":"كتاب فضائل المدينة"}},"section_detail":{"29":{"hadithnumber_first":1867,"hadithnumber_last":1890,"arabicnumber_first":1867,"arabicnumber_last":1890}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":1872,"arabicnumber":1872,"text":"Rapporté par Abu Humaid : Nous sommes revenus avec le Prophète (ﷺ) de Tabuk, et quand nous sommes arrivés près de Médine, le Prophète (ﷺ) a dit : « Voici Tabah. »","grades":[{"name":"Imam Bukhari","grade":"Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":29,"hadith":6},"chapter":{"id":3,"ara-name":"باب الْمَدِينَةُ طَابَةُ","eng-name":"Al-Madina is also called Taba","isFirstHadith":true}}]}